NC Digital builds custom ecommerce websites for Swansea businesses — online stores designed around your brand, built to load fast and convert visitors into customers. Every site we deliver is fully custom-designed; we don't use off-the-shelf themes.

Ecommerce sites start from **£800**, with the price depending on platform, product count, and functionality required.

## Ecommerce platforms we build for Swansea businesses

**Shopify** — a reliable, scalable choice for Swansea retailers and product-based businesses. We custom-design every Shopify store from scratch, so your brand stands out rather than blending in with every other Shopify site out there.

**WooCommerce** — WordPress-based and highly flexible. A great option for Swansea businesses that are already on WordPress, or that need custom functionality. All WooCommerce builds are fully custom-designed.

**SureCart** — a modern, lightweight solution for digital products, subscriptions, and service businesses wanting to take payments online. Custom-designed to fit your brand.

## What every Swansea ecommerce build includes

- Fully custom design — built around your brand, not a template
- Mobile-first — Swansea shoppers are on their phones; your store will work perfectly on every device
- Secure checkout with payment gateway integration (Stripe, PayPal, and more)
- Easy product management — you can add and update products yourself after launch
- On-page SEO for product and category pages
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking set up from day one

## Helping Swansea businesses sell online

Swansea has a strong retail and creative business community, and an ecommerce site gives you reach far beyond the city. We build stores for businesses at all sizes — from sole traders selling handmade goods to established retailers expanding their online presence.

We also offer [web design in Swansea](/web-design-swansea/) for businesses at an earlier stage, and [SEO in Swansea](/seo-swansea/) to help drive organic traffic to your store.

